        "answer": {
          "short": "$1.61$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{array}{r|rrrrrr}& &1&.&6&1&4\\\\\\hline 9&1&4&.&{}^{5}5&{}^{1}3&{}^{4}1\\end{array}$$\n$$14.531\\div9=1.614\\ldots$$\nThe third decimal digit is $4$, so round down.\n$$14.531\\div9\\approx1.61\\quad\\text{(2 decimal places)}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 39
      },
      {
        "id": "p91-q4-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$1.736\\div0.9$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1.93$",
          "worked": "$$1.736\\div0.9=17.36\\div9$$\n$$\\begin{array}{r|rrrrrr}& &1&.&9&2&8\\\\\\hline 9&1&7&.&{}^{8}3&{}^{2}6&{}^{8}0\\end{array}$$\n$$1.736\\div0.9=1.928\\ldots$$\nThe third decimal digit is $8$, so round up.\n$$1.736\\div0.9\\approx1.93\\quad\\text{(2 decimal places)}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 43
      },
      {
        "id": "p91-q4-c",
