          "worked": "$$2.54\\div1.3=25.4\\div13$$\n$$\\begin{array}{r|rrrrrr}& &1&.&9&5&3\\\\\\hline 13&2&5&.&{}^{12}4&{}^{7}0&{}^{5}0\\end{array}$$\n$$2.54\\div1.3=1.953\\ldots$$\nThe third decimal digit is $3$, so round down.\n$$2.54\\div1.3\\approx1.95\\quad\\text{(2 decimal places)}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
